    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Fuga Ashuru ghang'uda Yerusalemu muuwda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 32:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iidu nea ning'ata ng'asheesu ea gadiyoojusu bea doobiiwnatean Senakeribu was sugoocheanda Ashuru ghwahidu ak ghwanaaw Yuda ak gooduuwshi nea goofuursa geaw mujiinajeega sineaweesa hilooga, nea gwayeesha geaw gaygwajooriischi ak ghoah gaaschi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.32.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.32.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 32:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iidu nea ghwadaah Hesekiya gideaba Senakeribu nigasa gang'uchi Yerusalemu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.32.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.32.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 32:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "hean ghwalach girgweageeda sea fugaaschi hees ea fugaaschi meanyi ak ghwarat beega gheang'deenda mida jarooda mujiini; ak hean ghaweat saawa niny. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.32.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.32.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 32:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata ghabwat geat fuga saang'a, ak ghwarat gheanyanga sean bea eeniga ea ghealooda gulda aba jeeda ng'eanyiida, nea gwayeena, “Ghwasaan sugoodiga Ashuru gayghapka ak ghwanyas beega saang'a?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.32.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.32.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 32:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghang'eat gagadiiy aba uurda ng'ata ghwadeas ghamarda sean ghayi abeedeaysa ng'eanyi, ak gagatkat madalajeega aba headaanyi, ak aba jarooda ghwadeas ghamarda nuut, ak ghoahaat uurda mujiineeda Milo mida jeeda mujiineeda Dawdi. Aba ng'ata gwasin dabita ng'ucheeda ea igeambooniga saang'a. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.32.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.32.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 32:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata ghwaloat gharmucheanda shirikarajeega hees jea gamiineadaysa buuneeda, ak gooweamsa headaanyi aba bugharjeanda aba gidaghuuta mujiini ak goobaloola saawa hooseaneega, nea gwayeesha, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.32.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.32.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 32:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Adaruusiita nea goobeayi uurjeeni. Adiidu ghoabeali ghana gameewa gurooruunatkeagwa aba badayda sugoocheanda Ashuru ghana shirikarajeagaaschi sean mideawa; aba gideaba gwanda heedeanya siyagi haw burdeawa dea mideawa niny. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.32.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.32.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 32:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Niny gwandeawa geatinda saseeda; aba aseasa geendeawi NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETEANYA, was dea jea ghaweadeasa nea gang'uchi aba badahuukaasa.” Hean ghwanyas uurjeenga buuneeda aba ng'asheega Hesekiya was sugoocheanda Yuda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.32.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.32.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 32:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iidu nea ning'ata ng'asheesu Senakeribeeda was sugoocheanda Ashuru, nea ea gudu ghwanaaw Lakishi sea shirikarajeagaaschi, goojeakta fugaaschi bea gadiyeeda Yerusalemu heeda Hesekiya was sugoocheanda Yuda ea heeda fuga sean mida Yerusalemu, ak gwayeesha, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.32.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.32.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 32:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Gwayi Senakeribeeda was sugoocheanda Ashuru, ‘Ghoanyasiyeenu uurjeenga jea anaawana Yerusalemuun? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.32.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.32.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 32:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mii Hesekiyahi siida aschoaraneegwa naweeda, jea ak ghwanung' ashealana aba jalooda ea muwooshta, gheata eeshiineegwa, “NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETEANYA gaygwalealnaneasa geatinga sugoocheanda Ashuru”? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.32.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.32.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 32:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mii Hesekiyahi dea geanda headaanyi was heetiyeada ea headaanyi bea wagiida ak gwayeesha fuga Yuda ea Yerusalemu, “Asina ghadooweeda aba hijagi bea wagiida, ak aba badaydaanyi gajaghwarda haleanjeedeang'wa sisabwa geadi”? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.32.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.32.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 32:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agooga moanali gideasimi aniini sea ghweanigeasu fuga sean bea ng'eanyoojiga suurja? Heapi aseecheeka eemoojiga gayghoamu gwalealu ng'eanyoojiga nyaawa aba jeeda geatingeasu? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.32.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.32.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 32:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'eaha gil aba jeeda aseecheeka sea bea eemoojigiga ghayi huuyda ghweanigeasu jea ghoamu gwalealna fugaaschi geatingeasu, gideaba aseeteang'wa gayghoamu gwalealnaneegwa geatingeasu? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.32.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.32.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 32:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi ghamneawa adiidu gwareenganeegwa Hesekiya ghana ghoaschoaraneegwa naweeda aba ng'asheanji, nea adiidu goosisi masaweega niny, aba gideaba manda aseeta eemeanagi ghana sugoocheanduumeanagi ammu gwalealna fugaaschi geatingeasu ghana geatinga ghweanigeasu. Abeeda aseeteang'wa gaygwalealdaneagwaan aba geatingeasu!’”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.32.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.32.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 32:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.32.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.32.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 32:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean fugaaschi bea gadiyeeda ghwaak badayda NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETA ea badayda siidaanyi bea gadiyeeda siguura Hesekiya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.32.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.32.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 32:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata ghang'oar barawajeega goong'eawi NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETA fuga Israeli, ak gwayeesha, “Gawuurji aseecheeka eemoojiga ng'eanyiida ghayi raay gwalealna fuga nyaawa geatingeasu, hean eara ASEETA Hesekiya mayghoamu gwalealna fugaaschi geatingeasu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.32.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.32.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 32:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean goojuur aba giijuureanda haw aba iita fuga Yuda fuga Yerusalemu mida jeeda ghamarda ghwanung' ghang'ut muuwda, ghwanyas gichea ghaghasta mujiini. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.32.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.32.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 32:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghwanung' gooyang'deay ASEETA fuga Yerusalemu sea aseeta buuneeda bea ng'eanyiida, was gadiyoojiga geatinga buuneeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.32.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.32.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 32:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata Hesekiyaheeda was sugoocheanda ea Isayaheeda was sibaneeda, was orjeeda Amosi, gamusiischi aba ng'asheanji nea gooyeawusa humng'eeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.32.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.32.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 32:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean goojeagu NG'UTAMIIDA malaykajeanda, ak ghabwar gameewa shirikarajeega hees uurjeeni sea fuga hees mida jeeda museasooda sugoocheanda Ashuru. Ng'ata gabiikta ng'eanyiidaanyi nea gaba baspaseega. Hean nea ghwahita jeeda gheeda ASEATAANYI, ghabwara ng'uta orjoagaaschi ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.32.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.32.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 32:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gwalealu NG'UTAMIIDA Hesekiya sea gheaptanga Yerusalemu aba geatinga Senakeribeeda was sugoocheanda Ashuru ea aba heeda geatinga weajoodiga aba ng'ata ghoadaw fuufeanda aba meadajeega sean. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.32.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.32.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 32:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gweadu fuga saang'a haleanjeeda guskuseega heeda NG'UTAMIIDA aba Yerusalemu ea haleanjeeda haw shaayaat heeda Hesekiya was sugoocheanda Yuda, ak eara niny geakghaambiit aba damandida aba madeeda eemoojiga sean.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.32.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.32.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Miyeeda Hesekiya ea ghwarjeeda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 32:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.32.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.32.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 32:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean aba eawoojigiga ghang'uta Hesekiya miyeanda ea ghwariikghta ghami, ak ghamoash NG'UTAMIIDA; hean ghwasha ghuutaanyi ak ghoadaw gwadeagooda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.32.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.32.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 32:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak hean eara aba gida sisissa Hesekiya ea mwayamwa geaw, aba gideaba gurooroadaanyi gaba ghwarja. Hean ghwahidu nyarasta badaydaanyi ea badayda Yuda ea Yerusalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.32.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.32.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 32:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gwahiing'sa geaw ng'eanyi Hesekiya aba ghwarjeeda gurooroadaanyi, niny sea fuga abiita Yerusalemu, ak ea mudu ghwahidu nyarasta NG'UTAMIIDA heanyaawa aba damanda Hesekiya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.32.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.32.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Meanang'oocheanduumeeda Hesekiya ea mureeda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 32:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.32.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.32.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 32:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata ghwanyas Hesekiya baruureega muuchi ea mureeda; ak goodiiwsa geaw lapiya, ea gea dahaabu, ea gea lagheanga hees sheayeat, ea gea geediga ng'andidi, ea gea igeambooniga, ea gea haleanjeeda sean bea sheayeeda haw; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.32.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.32.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 32:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ea gijigoonga mbeeyooda booga, ea difaayi, ea nagheeda; ea mbarariida hawanyoojigaaschi sean, ea hilooga gisilgaaschi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.32.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.32.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 32:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba ng'ata gwasissa geaw mujiinajeega, ea gisilga ea dugwa saang'a; aba gideaba NG'UTAMIIDA niidaw niny baruureega muuchi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.32.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.32.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 32:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean Hesekiya gil dea rat gheanyanga eeniga Gihoni ak ghwararang'aada gaweay gwaraksa mujiineeda Dawdi. Hean ghwanyagaada Hesekiya aba gadiyoojigaaschi sean. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.32.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.32.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 32:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea aba ng'asheega giijasoodiga fuga hees bea Babeli, ghayi siicheaksa niny eepearsa gwadeagooda ghayi sisin aba badayda ng'eanyiida, gwanung'usa ASEETA niny heeda, ak gwasimsim ghwanal haleanjeeda sean mida gurooroadaanyi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.32.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.32.31"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
