          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean haleanjeeda siipuut bea gadiyoojiga Hesekiya, ea gadiyoojigaaschi miyaas, sing'oorsa jeeda gisiihiimsa sibaneeda siguura Isaya was orjeeda Amosi, was jeeda gitaabooda sugoodiga Yuda ea Israeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.32.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.32.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 32:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata ghami Hesekiya, ak geebung'sa heetuukusa heetiyeada bea bung'eadinga orjooga Dawdi; ak Yudaheeda sean sea fuga abiita Yerusalemu gwasissa niny mureeda damanda miyeadaanyi. Ak gawa hoorgeadaanyi goombaliischi orjeedaanyi siguura Manase.",
          "type": "text",
